    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_007:6fddde0e",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03",
        "key": "SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_007",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_007:6fddde0e",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_007:6fddde0e",
        "jp_sha256": "e38fdb9fc52e3fb1a6c1ac529bc77c72af6241a5fe43cdc51a98eee0ebe9aa87",
        "official_en_sha256": "e0e8ca2eec461eb8f96e3e9d4780216918e33a042aca3e5aaf4249536f213d34"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いや、まだ納得できるものにはなってない。\r\n俺の魔法剣はもっと高みにいけるはずだ。",
        "official_en": "And yet, I feel dissatisfied with my abilities. There must be something higher to reach for.",
        "real_en": "No, I'm still not satisfied.\nI know I can take my spellblade techniques further."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
