    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_019:c0947201",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03",
        "key": "SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_019",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_019:c0947201",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_019:c0947201",
        "jp_sha256": "7b61d434d1ea9ad43895982da5e39b56277161fe43ca4218cadc0f7970a6ef94",
        "official_en_sha256": "e2a6ffce61de25ddf5a1cae0c0c9fe342036bdfeeafcd8744d617ae6657e8d02"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、魔法剣を使う方法を探して世界中を旅したの。",
        "official_en": "To prove them wrong, I journeyed the land, searching for a way to learn the secrets of the spellblade.",
        "real_en": "So I traveled the world looking for a way to use spellblade techniques."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
