        "official_en_sha256": "a418105c13c6e7ebebca08d0d2ca0b76ca6140db9b65201d6beaa0599af8c7df"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、何度も挫折したわ。\r\nエルフはほとんど滅びていてね。",
        "official_en": "There were many setbacks, owing mainly to the fact that the elves are all but extinct.",
        "real_en": "But I ran into setback after setback.\nThe elves were all but extinct."
