      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "やっぱり後輩クンは\r\n私の見込んだ通りの人だったわ。",
        "official_en": "It appears I was right in my evaluation of you—you may have what it takes.",
        "real_en": "Just as I thought, Kouhai-kun.\r\nYou've lived up to my expectations."
      },
