        "key": "SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_009",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_009:fd19d3f9",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_009:fd19d3f9",
        "jp_sha256": "5a7a363a42feea4ff84758f936fe4e139386568c3d4b28611c7ea4c65f068c9f",
        "official_en_sha256": "0e1d44702d30d7659e1fe45c541160d062bb55f9e0f7a05c467e814b1fbcdbd0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "地道な鍛錬を続けるのを苦にしない。\r\nそれこそが魔法剣を使うために必要な素質なの。",
        "official_en": "Embracing training, almost as a lifestyle. <text style=\"italic\">That</> is what it truly takes to master the art of the spellblade.",
        "real_en": "You don't mind putting in steady training.\nThat's exactly what you need to wield a spellblade."
      },
      "review": {
