        "key": "SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_016",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_016:c005767f",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C01_Silvia_03:SubEv_C01_Silvia_03_016:c005767f",
        "jp_sha256": "165f84f9320c72aba2982738881c8c5ad8826d2b4a6a822a02d3eeb83aeb254d",
        "official_en_sha256": "1026e482f76fd52171d2d09157e5553b4772365e015721fc24cf1dede353cca0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "魔法剣って元々はエルフって種族の技術で\r\n人間には使えないって言われていたの。",
        "official_en": "Originally, only a race called elves were able imbue their weapons with magic. It was considered impossible for humans to achieve this.",
        "real_en": "Spellblade techniques originally belonged to the elves.\nPeople said humans couldn't use them."
      },
